  "On-board touch CST816S / IMU SDA": "板载触摸 CST816S / IMU 的 SDA",
  "One side to a GPIO (enable the internal pull-up), the other to GND. Don't put it on C3 GPIO9 / S3 GPIO0 and hold it at power-up.": "一端接 GPIO（开内部上拉），一端接 GND。别接在 C3 GPIO9 / S3 GPIO0 上又在上电时按着。",
  "Only 11 GPIOs broken out: D0–D10 map to GPIO1–9, 43, 44; GPIO21 drives the user LED; D2 (GPIO3) is a strapping pin but harmless with default eFuses; D6 / D7 are UART0; battery pads and a charger are on the back.": "只引出 11 个 GPIO，D0–D10 对应 GPIO1–9、43、44；GPIO21 接了板载用户 LED；D2（GPIO3）是 strapping 脚，默认 eFuse 下不影响启动；D6 / D7 是 UART0；背面有锂电焊盘和充电电路。",
  "Open drain; level set by an external 4.7 kΩ pull-up": "开漏，电平由外接 4.7 kΩ 上拉决定",
  "Passive buzzer 12 mm (bare part, magnetic)": "无源蜂鸣器 12 mm（裸件，电磁式）",
  "Passive buzzer module (3-pin, with transistor)": "无源蜂鸣器模块（三针，带三极管）",
  "Passive buzzer with S8050 driver module": "无源蜂鸣器和 S8050 驱动模块",
  "Powers servos or LED strips separately; tie its ground to the dev board GND. Buy a certified one.": "给舵机或灯带单独供电，地线要和开发板 GND 接在一起。买 3C 认证的。",
  "Print the shade in milky PLA to diffuse the LEDs. Stick the strip on the light pipe, a little away from the shade wall, to avoid hot spots.": "灯罩用乳白 PLA 打印才能把灯珠的光打散；灯带贴在导光柱上，离灯罩壁远一点才不会有亮点。",
  "Proprietary single-wire protocol; at least 2 s between reads. The data line is pulled up to module VCC, so on 5 V it is a 5 V signal.": "单总线私有协议，两次读之间至少 2 s。数据线上拉到模块 VCC：用 5 V 供电时数据线是 5 V。",
  "Pull AD0 high for 0x69": "AD0 拉高改 0x69",
  "Pull-up goes to 3V3 (not 5 V). Several probes can share one wire, told apart by their 64-bit ROM codes.": "上拉电阻接 3V3（不要接 5 V）。一条线可以挂多个，靠 64 位 ROM 码区分。",
  "Put it across the LED strip or servo supply to absorb start-up spikes.": "并在灯带或舵机电源两端，吸收启动尖峰。",
  "QMI8658 6-axis module": "QMI8658 六轴模块",
  "QST QMI8658C 6-axis IMU breakout": "QST QMI8658C 六轴 IMU 小板",
  "RGB LED on GPIO48 (v1.1 moved it to GPIO38; check the back silkscreen). Octal PSRAM takes GPIO33–37. Two Type-C ports: UART and native USB.": "彩灯在 GPIO48（v1.1 改到 GPIO38，看板背丝印）。八线 PSRAM 占 GPIO33–37。两个 Type-C：UART 口和原生 USB 口。",
  "Resistor kit (incl. 220 Ω, 1 k, 2 k, 4.7 k, 10 k)": "常用电阻套装（含 220 Ω、1 k、2 k、4.7 k、10 k）",
  "Run two Dupont wires from the screw terminal to the breadboard power rails.": "螺丝端子接两根杜邦线到面包板电源轨。",
  "S8050 NPN transistor (TO-92, with 1 kΩ base resistor)": "S8050 NPN 三极管（TO-92，配 1 kΩ 基极电阻）",
  "SG90 servo (180°, plastic gears)": "SG90 舵机（180°，塑料齿）",
  "SH1106 1.3″ 4-pin I2C module": "SH1106 1.3″ 四针 I2C 模块",
  "SSD1306 0.96″ 4-pin I2C module": "SSD1306 0.96″ 四针 I2C 模块",
  "ST7789 1.54″ IPS LCD module": "ST7789 1.54″ IPS LCD 模块",
  "Same shape as the no-touch version, but display reset is on GPIO14 and backlight on GPIO2 (GPIO12 / 40 on the no-touch one), so firmware pins depend on the version. Only 6 GPIOs on the SH1.0 connector are exposed.": "和无触摸版同一款外形，但屏复位在 GPIO14、背光在 GPIO2（无触摸版是 GPIO12 / 40），固件要按版本改引脚。对外只有 SH1.0 接口上的 6 个 GPIO。",
  "Same size and connector as the SG90, with sturdier gears. The simulator uses the same servo model (torque is not modelled).": "和 SG90 同尺寸同接口，齿轮耐用。模拟器用同一个舵机模型（不区分扭矩）。",
  "Seeed Wiki only says 8 MB; \"octal\" comes from PlatformIO qio_opi": "Seeed Wiki 只写 8 MB，八线来自 PlatformIO qio_opi",
  "Seeed Wiki power section says 3V3 gives 700 mA, the spec table says 500 mA; they contradict": "Seeed Wiki 电源脚一节写 3V3 可取 700 mA、规格表写 500 mA，互相矛盾",
  "Some 1.3″ 7-pin versions have no CS pin and need SPI mode 3. The simulator has no ST7789 model yet.": "有的 1.3″ 七针版没有 CS 脚，要用 SPI 模式 3。模拟器还没有 ST7789 模型。",
  "Some batches have VCC and GND swapped, so wire by the silkscreen, not by the picture.": "有的批次 VCC 和 GND 的引脚顺序是对调的，按丝印接，别按图接。",
  "Spinner body and turntable base (3D-printed)": "小黄身体和转台底座（3D 打印）",
  "TMB12A05-style active magnetic buzzer": "TMB12A05 类有源电磁蜂鸣器",
  "TP4056 USB-C Li-ion charger module (with protection)": "TP4056 Type-C 锂电充电模块（带保护）",
  "The \"SDA / SCL\" silkscreen is really SPI MOSI / SCLK, not I2C. Write-only, no MISO.": "丝印「SDA / SCL」其实是 SPI 的 MOSI / SCLK，不是 I2C。只写不读，没有 MISO。",
  "The DevKitC-1 is about 25 mm wide, so on an 830-hole breadboard only one row of holes stays free on one side; two boards side by side is the usual fix.": "DevKitC-1 宽 25 mm 左右，插上 830 孔面包板只剩一侧一排孔可用；两块并排是常见做法。",
  "The ZS-042 board has a battery charging circuit; with a non-rechargeable CR2032 people usually remove that diode or resistor (not calibrated on hardware).": "ZS-042 板上有给电池的充电电路，装不可充的 CR2032 时常见做法是拆掉那颗二极管或电阻（未经真机标定）。",
  "The chip is discontinued; most on sale are clones. 0x68 clashes with the DS3231. Simulator: registers, ranges, sample rate and DATA_RDY follow the datasheet, readings come from the bench pose; FIFO and DMP are not simulated yet.": "芯片已停产，市面多为兼容片。0x68 和 DS3231 撞地址。模拟器：寄存器、量程、采样率、DATA_RDY 按数据手册，读数由台面姿态算出；FIFO 和 DMP 暂未模拟。",
  "The long leg is positive. Always add a series resistor (220 Ω or more), or you burn the LED or damage the pin.": "长脚正极。必须串电阻（220 Ω 起），不然会烧灯或伤引脚。",
  "The plug needs a DC jack to turn it into two wires for the breadboard": "插头要经 DC 母座转成面包板能接的两根线",
  "The servo bay sits in the base, and the round display cable runs through the hole in the shaft.": "舵机仓在底座里，圆屏排线穿转轴中心孔。",
  "The strip cannot be powered from the dev board USB": "灯带不能从开发板 USB 取电",
  "The touch chip sleeps a few seconds after the last touch and stops answering I2C, so the driver must pulse TP_RST first or wait for INT before reading. The simulator does not model auto-sleep; confirm this on real hardware.": "触摸芯片无触摸几秒后自动睡眠、I2C 不应答，驱动要么先拉 TP_RST，要么等 INT 再读；模拟器没有模拟自动睡眠，这一点必须上真机确认。",
  "The weather station alarm uses this. Wire I/O straight to a GPIO.": "气象站的报警用这个。I/O 直接接 GPIO 即可。",
  "Thin wires drop voltage under servo or LED strip current, so keep power wires short.": "细线承载舵机或灯带的大电流会掉压，电源线尽量短。",
  "This is the IMU on the Waveshare ESP32-S3 round-display boards. Without address auto-increment in CTRL1, burst reads keep reading the same register, and the simulator does the same. Data is treated as little-endian (not calibrated on hardware).": "微雪 ESP32-S3 圆屏板上板载的就是它。CTRL1 不开地址自增时，连续读会一直读同一个寄存器，模拟器也是这样。数据按小端处理（未经真机标定）。",
